msgid "Kexi"
msgstr "Kexi"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: kexi.appdata.xml:7
msgid "Database Creator"
msgstr "Editor de bases da datos"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: kexi.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"Kexi is a visual database creator, part of the Calligra Suite. It can be used"
" for designing database applications, inserting and editing data, performing"
" queries, and processing data. Forms can be created to provide a custom"
" interface to your data. All database objects - tables, queries, forms,"
" reports - are stored in the database, making it easy to share data and"
" design."
msgstr ""

